
USAGE
        Help [<command>]

DESCRIPTION
        Gives help for the specified command or this text if no
        command is specified. Use the "?" command to retrieve a list
        of available commands.
        A command may be abbreviated down to its capital letters:
        SYSop may be typed SYS, HNodes HN, Help H. The same goes for
        the command given to Help: "H SYS" gives the help of SYSop.
